    "description": "Prompts each subject model to lie or to be honest about TriviaQA questions that it answers correctly, with 64 honesty-inducing and 64 lie-inducing system prompts (pressure, roleplay and direct instruction, for example). Half of the lie prompts also tell the model to keep its lie when it is challenged. A lie detector then labels each reply as a lie or not. About 5,000 samples for each model.",
